  "steps": [
    "<strong>Butter Chickpeas:</strong> Heat oil over medium. Sauté onion 5–7 min until soft and lightly golden. Add garlic and ginger 1 min. Add spices; toast ~30 sec. Stir in tomato paste.",
    "Add chickpeas; toss to coat. Pour in coconut milk and water/stock; simmer gently ~10–12 min until sauce thickens. Stir in nutritional yeast/vegan butter if using; season with salt & pepper. Finish with lemon/lime and coriander.",
    "<strong>Quick Garlic Naan:</strong> Mix flour, baking powder, salt. Add yoghurt + warm water → soft dough. Knead 3–4 min. Heat skillet medium-high. Divide into 6 balls; flatten. Brush with oil/butter and sprinkle garlic. Cook 2–3 min per side until puffed and spotted. Brush with extra garlic butter + herbs."
  ],
  "tips": [
    "For extra buttery depth, swirl in vegan butter or cashew cream at the end.",
    "Make naan gluten-free by using a 1:1 GF flour blend (texture varies).",
    "Dial heat up with extra paprika or chilli flakes."
  ]
